{
  "topic_id": "t-mm-06-014",
  "book_id": "book-mm-06",
  "title": "14. STEPS OF ANTERIOR REPAIR:",
  "source_sha256": "f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605",
  "block_count": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-06-014\" hidden></div>\n<h2 class=\"mm-heading mm-h2 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8798]\" style=\"background-color: #2F5496; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>14. </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>STEPS OF ANTERIOR REPAIR:</strong></span></h2>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8799]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Anterior Repair Steps:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8800]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Before surgery the routine steps taken before any operative procedure should be carried out.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8801]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Primary incision is full length of anterior vaginal wall, tented by four Allis clamps.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"cf437efaea0ecc0445103f5d\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure cf437efaea0ecc0445103f5d\" viewbox=\"0 0 3295650 2495550\" width=\"346\" height=\"262\" data-mm-natural-width=\"346\" data-mm-natural-height=\"262\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"f314f4ba8c62d1ffd1c6cc7e63dc549a17b3072e9664795491c58fb8832db6e8\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-4e0bbff3d366e405c6bd\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 3292567 0 L 3292567 2496222 L 0 2496222 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"4e0bbff3d366e405c6bd\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-4e0bbff3d366e405c6bd)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/e2d671c84e064b6f15c1aeca3a45570f9eff4f40865e3288cf8eb38dc5cfe56e.png\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"3292567\" height=\"2496222\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8803]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Incision of inner surface of vaginal wall to separate viscovaginal connective tissues.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"82410394b41305ac222cfdb7\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 82410394b41305ac222cfdb7\" viewbox=\"0 0 3505200 2362200\" width=\"368\" height=\"248\" data-mm-natural-width=\"368\" data-mm-natural-height=\"248\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"36b61f78eafed7d59528514f1e4504b43591763196d6ae195630f9fcce18bbe7\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-63e2f1f47658370fb2a5\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 3500086 0 L 3500086 2363626 L 0 2363626 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"63e2f1f47658370fb2a5\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-63e2f1f47658370fb2a5)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/482fda06dfdd8302f7932c1aac7ca3473383820f1e4dd358e5f251edaae8add8.png\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"3500086\" height=\"2363626\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8805]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Further separation of connective tissues and bladder from vaginal flap by rolling </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>gauze-covered index finger from vaginal wall toward bladder.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"964bc955a2579cd06b8c0ef1\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 964bc955a2579cd06b8c0ef1\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2771775 2247900\" width=\"291\" height=\"236\" data-mm-natural-width=\"291\" data-mm-natural-height=\"236\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"8938337c2fcc379dc2e8da85861db57988f41ce28f06590ad71baa1ca225b48b\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-7ecc552e505d914d7294\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2247594 0 L 2247594 1717217 L 0 1717217 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"7ecc552e505d914d7294\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-7ecc552e505d914d7294)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/d99075fea9826ad67c041492c02b089743b40fcecdcae966f02417ae1d734960.jfif\" x=\"-1044785.86330983\" y=\"-5149082.04645075\" width=\"7475036.58374351\" height=\"12844767.74627871\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2247594 0 L 2247594 1717217 L 0 1717217 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8807]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Sharp separation of bladder from vaginal apex.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"4a287c09fa8943c8df029c15\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 4a287c09fa8943c8df029c15\" viewbox=\"-247650 -266700 2733675 2571750\" width=\"287\" height=\"270\" data-mm-natural-width=\"287\" data-mm-natural-height=\"270\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"4a3f729867766baf3d4388f6165f05c7b3c28f72382d6184a374fbaa75461e7a\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-18a43d6e2baa5343b80f\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2211926 0 L 2211926 2047426 L 0 2047426 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"18a43d6e2baa5343b80f\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-18a43d6e2baa5343b80f)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/d99075fea9826ad67c041492c02b089743b40fcecdcae966f02417ae1d734960.jfif\" x=\"-1159583.59753836\" y=\"-9172855.92903607\" width=\"8725890.56767525\" height=\"15134727.97161442\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2211926 0 L 2211926 2047426 L 0 2047426 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8809]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Separation of bladder pillars to promote bladder advancement</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"7c70e3507e5c797ffe68fbd5\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 7c70e3507e5c797ffe68fbd5\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2667000 2657475\" width=\"280\" height=\"279\" data-mm-natural-width=\"280\" data-mm-natural-height=\"279\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"8268153519e13277f1b1affcedf79c75a3867006f94f17c5fc756a8be7ef7755\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-d8ef3a563e742abec488\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2203989 0 L 2203989 2154999 L 0 2154999 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"d8ef3a563e742abec488\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-d8ef3a563e742abec488)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/f66c59b7e1420afa4881f89a76ef7af0a8c9eaa6175057b020e4ef2ac196854b.jfif\" x=\"-1408227.65050459\" y=\"-5782578.27157142\" width=\"10110041.28440367\" height=\"14270571.48533211\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2203989 0 L 2203989 2154999 L 0 2154999 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8811]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Palpation of ureter</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"4ed7eb2c90d370c52fa04ecc\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 4ed7eb2c90d370c52fa04ecc\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2486025 2657475\" width=\"261\" height=\"279\" data-mm-natural-width=\"261\" data-mm-natural-height=\"279\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"b5380691f4b907bfbf439c640113346471aa01e34b27236011650b6f19a83d83\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-eb215f27dfeb9e3c3e0a\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2009696 0 L 2009696 2167703 L 0 2167703 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"eb215f27dfeb9e3c3e0a\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-eb215f27dfeb9e3c3e0a)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/f66c59b7e1420afa4881f89a76ef7af0a8c9eaa6175057b020e4ef2ac196854b.jfif\" x=\"-1639724.82971539\" y=\"-10323409.33069878\" width=\"12118282.68210323\" height=\"16011988.4768799\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2009696 0 L 2009696 2167703 L 0 2167703 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8813]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>First plication suture at the urethrovesical angle. Arrows indicate the varying path of the imbrication sutures</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"75b335dbb218aa839e7cc0f1\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 75b335dbb218aa839e7cc0f1\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 3057525 2886075\" width=\"321\" height=\"303\" data-mm-natural-width=\"321\" data-mm-natural-height=\"303\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"e1af589d95d2baf1fe93e4ee39cc0e70ae0915e75e3a635ee65ab742ae3bb17d\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-f77aaed79b39d97c2bbb\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2593871 0 L 2593871 2401238 L 0 2401238 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"f77aaed79b39d97c2bbb\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-f77aaed79b39d97c2bbb)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/819258f0923b5dd1b03b5bb6c28fe5f2a7e3ced9308dd219d8a490d459023407.jfif\" x=\"-1497731.17553545\" y=\"-7350985.85569963\" width=\"10766524.15739665\" height=\"19101408.00254555\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2593871 0 L 2593871 2401238 L 0 2401238 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8815]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #404040; font-family: \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Only after the first layer of imbrication sutures is in place does blunt dissection extend further laterally, exposing denser layers of connective tissue.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8816]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"6d2ff387762b5eebd2b97340\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 6d2ff387762b5eebd2b97340\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2847975 2638425\" width=\"299\" height=\"277\" data-mm-natural-width=\"299\" data-mm-natural-height=\"277\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"c28de682ec28833bb2ebf2b220852d48bba58d41a64c332f06ebd4bd2a46ce3d\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-f2160e330bc53d007cc6\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2343195 0 L 2343195 2124314 L 0 2124314 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"f2160e330bc53d007cc6\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-f2160e330bc53d007cc6)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/819258f0923b5dd1b03b5bb6c28fe5f2a7e3ced9308dd219d8a490d459023407.jfif\" x=\"-1668055.8708882\" y=\"-8819420.26804258\" width=\"12293137.82068097\" height=\"13874430.14825942\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2343195 0 L 2343195 2124314 L 0 2124314 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8818]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Additional layers of plication may be appropriate.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"50a687044e52142c91134ad8\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 50a687044e52142c91134ad8\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2886075 2828925\" width=\"303\" height=\"297\" data-mm-natural-width=\"303\" data-mm-natural-height=\"297\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"2bad14496c84fcd4a3b410cef47c07cc68a5a8e1b64eb59cabc5a067634e8233\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-83fe7de0ee6f9e58b1ec\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2353019 0 L 2353019 2279881 L 0 2279881 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"83fe7de0ee6f9e58b1ec\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-83fe7de0ee6f9e58b1ec)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/ec213bd49cafbf61c5f3fbd8141e646575ed47ae65a58dccd34d51b581e4603f.jfif\" x=\"-1107407.28539157\" y=\"-5380929.87728841\" width=\"8053871.16648412\" height=\"13334976.89653155\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 2353019 0 L 2353019 2279881 L 0 2279881 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8820]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #404040; font-family: \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Excision of redundant anterior vaginal wall</strong></span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"9e50e30dccdf4207d0fda5c3\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 9e50e30dccdf4207d0fda5c3\" viewbox=\"-266700 -266700 2276475 2562225\" width=\"239\" height=\"269\" data-mm-natural-width=\"239\" data-mm-natural-height=\"269\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"44b0bc609d28a74e9acbde9e38219f73004d623181c1d34b5f167ac5d825bf75\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-e1794b2fba83bac4d29b\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1774675 0 L 1774675 2039373 L 0 2039373 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"e1794b2fba83bac4d29b\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-e1794b2fba83bac4d29b)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/ec213bd49cafbf61c5f3fbd8141e646575ed47ae65a58dccd34d51b581e4603f.jfif\" x=\"-798693.34988219\" y=\"-5405031.40274394\" width=\"5973325.47963649\" height=\"8716386.71624567\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1774675 0 L 1774675 2039373 L 0 2039373 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"190500\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8822]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The vaginal vault is pushed back to its normal location, allowing evaluation of vaginal length and caliber. Posterior rotation of the urethra as a result of tension of the anterior vaginal wall can be assessed at this point.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8823]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8824]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[8825]\" style=\"margin-top: 10.3pt; margin-bottom: 10.3pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"e9d956424742ea68aa21a98d\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-06-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure e9d956424742ea68aa21a98d\" viewbox=\"-285750 -266700 2257425 2352675\" width=\"237\" height=\"247\" data-mm-natural-width=\"237\" data-mm-natural-height=\"247\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"29a4cbcdc8707bc3827da76c399312748417464e9d3359a212b333ce5985fb66\"><defs><clippath id=\"clip-aaf2dd30f7c5b6eac7aa\" clippathunits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 1716452 0 L 1716452 1849572 L 0 1849572 Z\"></path></clippath></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"aaf2dd30f7c5b6eac7aa\" transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\" clip-path=\"url(#clip-aaf2dd30f7c5b6eac7aa)\"><image href=\"/uploads/content-images/maternal-mind-book/f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605/media/ed56d4c80bc361b8b55f92ac5942dfbe68779d38ef73f768a6ca8ef80842489c.jfif\" x=\"-1228109.31830986\" y=\"-4682947.34174837\" width=\"9122785.01195854\" height=\"10858756.53143897\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\"></image><path d=\"M 0 0 